### Get all todos
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos

### Simulate IllegalArgumentException
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos/illegal

### Get todo by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos/1

### Get todo by id - validation error (non-positive id)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/todos/-1

### Create todo
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn VS Code REST Client",
  "description": "Test endpoints from inside VS Code"
}

### Create todo - validation error (title too short)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "a",
  "description": "Test endpoints from inside VS Code"
}

### Update todo
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "description": "Updated from VS Code",
  "completed": true
}

### Delete todo
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/todos/1

### Meta
GET http://localhost:8081/api/meta

### Meta version
GET http://localhost:8081/api/meta/version

### Meta port
GET http://localhost:8081/api/meta/port

### Meta Java home
GET http://localhost:8081/api/meta/java-home

### Meta path
GET http://localhost:8081/api/meta/path
